25,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The bay has a weight limit, and evening hires mean we can't have things that can't be moved or closed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Toshio,,People prefer interactive elements or live presence over static cases. The data shows a clear preference for activity.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The lab is almost empty! Only one person is working there, and there's a huge pile of stuff waiting.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Shipping paperwork has caused delays before, and powered displays are breaking down constantly during gallery hours.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Transport costs are eating a third of our installation budget, and the cost of custom mounts is skyrocketing.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Benjamin, does that mean we should avoid exhibitions with many heavy, custom-mounted loans?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, if the lab is backed up, a show requiring heavy conservation work would be a disaster.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Rin,,"Exactly! We need something the volunteers can handle, and we have plenty of town history buffs.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Daisuke, if we have powered displays, we need to be careful about the maintenance logs I saw.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. It seems we need a balance between visitor appeal and fiscal or structural reality.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm worried about anything too heavy or too fragile for the evening events.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We should prioritize a candidate that brings people in but doesn't break the bank or the floor.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Rin,,And doesn't break the staff! We can't ask the lab to do more.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm leaning away from anything with complex shipping or high-maintenance machinery.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,A prudent approach. Let us see the candidates and apply these constraints logically.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
